WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.934
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:06.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.033
I am your host,
Midlife Crisis Teen Wolf.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.534
Man, the '80s were
such a different time.

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.234
Back then,
inflation was out of control,

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:17.701
there was a cold war
with Russia,

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.934
and everyone was worried
that the President was too old.

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:22.167
Weren't -- Those are --

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.734
Let's get to some news here.

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.367
Apparently,
in a private conversation,

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.767
President Biden
told the Reverend Al Sharpton

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:30.234
that he's going to run again
in 2024.

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.934
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:33.501
Meanwhile, today
Kamala Harris was like,

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.634
"Uh, Joe, anything you'd
like to privately tell me?

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.367
I mean, hello."

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.534
Yeah, that information
wasn't supposed to get out.

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:41.033
Then Sharpton was like,

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:44.067
"He also told me that his
AOL password is grapenuts46."

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:47.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.367
"Exclamation point."

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.868
Yeah, it sounds like Biden
is gonna run again.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.267
He was like, "It's time

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:55.467
to capitalize
on my 42% approval rating."

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:57.100
Yeah, that's right.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.801
Get this --
former president Trump

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.334
is claiming that CNN
is trying to hurt his image

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:03.634
ahead of the 2024 election,
and he announced

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:08.033
a $475-million defamation
lawsuit against the network.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.067
In response, CNN was like,

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:13.868
"Hey, thanks for thinking
we have that kind of money.

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:14.901
That's, uh -- Wow.

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:16.901
We pay Anderson Cooper
in Panera bucks.

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:19.400
You know what I mean?"

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.801
Meanwhile I read that Trump

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:22.901
is thinking about running mates
for 2024,

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.801
and he's considering
his former press secretary

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.334
Sarah Huckabee Sanders,

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:28.868
as well as South Carolina
senator Tim Scott.

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.367
But trump wants to keep
his options open, so he just

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:33.334
sent out a questionnaire
for anyone interested.

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:34.868
We got ahold
of the questionnaire.

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:36.234
-Really?
-Take a look at this.

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:39.467
First it says...

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:46.067
Next it asked...

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:52.334
Just by thinking it.
The next question is...

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:59.434
And finally...

00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:00.968
And that's -- So if you --

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:03.300
Hopefully he'll find someone
and they'll get it together.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.934
I'm sure he'll find someone.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.200
Well, here's some big news.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.033
After months of trying
to back out of the deal,

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:10.801
Elon Musk just told Twitter

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:12.534
that he's now ready
to buy the company

00:02:12.534 --> 00:02:15.934
for his original offer
of $44 billion.

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:17.968
To break it down
in Twitter terms,

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:20.701
the deal was followed, blocked,
then unblocked, okay?

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:22.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:24.901
After the news broke, Twitter
stock jumped more than 20%.

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:26.901
When they heard that,
Twitter was like,

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:28.400
"In that case,
we're backing out of the deal.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.734
I mean, we're --
we're doing well."

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:31.133
Well, everyone's
talking about this --

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.033
I heard that Tom Brady
and Gisele Bundchen

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:34.067
have hired divorce lawyers.

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:35.968
[ Audience awws ]

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:39.000
Even crazier, Brady first
broke the news to Al Sharpton.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:44.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:46.534
And finally,
I saw that Snoop Dogg

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:49.434
is launching a THC version
of Funyuns.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:52.701
[ Cheers and laughter ]

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:54.200
It's a great idea.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.534
Hopefully this will finally
get stoners to eat Funyuns.

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:59.300
We have a great show.
It's a total '80s show tonight.

